refused: d109_same_base_doesnt_mix.cy:12:33, line 12 column 33
12 |     let $b: i32.money.dollars = $a + 1 money.cents;
   |                                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 what: this mixes `i32.money.dollars` and `i32.money.cents`
 why:  the same units can add and compare, and mixing them is refused (D100)
